  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ethiopia &#x2013; Human Rights and Peacebuilding Programme (HARP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Human Rights and Peacebuilding (HARP) programme will support the UK&#x2019;s strategic response to conflict in Ethiopia. The programme will support peacebuilding initiatives in areas where the UK has a comparative advantage. This will build the capacity of local peace actors (particularly women and youth), provide safe spaces for dialogue and engage with government to respond to community needs. The UK has proven success in investing in these areas in Ethiopia &#x2013; particularly through the CSSF Funded work of Conciliation Resources in Somali Regional State. HARP will look to continue this activity, as well as supporting further peacebuilding activity in other conflict areas.</narrative>
  </description>
